{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美股業績期展開，高富金融集團投資總監梁偉民認為，美股有一個板塊，受累於人工智能助理冒起，近月從高位大幅調整，但相信今份業績或給予市場信心，可博約一成反彈。睇片拆解是哪一個板塊！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:39:17.670216+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:44.910680+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:37:40.093826+00:00","content_hash":"7b330af343f42964d73a52cc9a43482093c530af51ad266ba4e6f4e1859e13e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}